en.-he-looks-deep-in-thought." class="photo-container" index="7" data-v-b709af2f><picture data-v-b709af2f><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_109469e29.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C3553%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C3553%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C3553%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An older man is sat on a sofa with a laptop on his knee. The Evri website is visible on the screen. He looks deep in thought." width="1200" height="280" class="photo-block" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-b709af2f></picture></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="8" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="how-to-send-an-international-parcel" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>How to send an international parcel</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>With delivery to over 200 countries and territories worldwide, we make sending international parcels easy. We’ll ask for more information about your parcel to help speed up the customs process. Our online booking collects all the information needed to make it fast and stress-free for you. Follow our three easy steps to post to Africa and the Middle East with ease:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>1</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Book your parcel delivery</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Visit our website and choose to drop off your parcel or arrange a collection from your home or office. You can also book with us in person at selected Post Office ParcelShops.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>2</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Print your label</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Print your postage label at home or at a local ParcelShop using our free Print in ParcelShop devices.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>3</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Drop off your parcel or wait for its collection</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Choose from 10,000+ locations near you to drop off your parcel at a  ParcelShop or Evri Locker. If you&#39;ve booked a courier collection service, we&#39;ll give you a 1-hour window on the day for when we&#39;ll collect your package.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="shipping-to-africa-and-the-middle-east-from-the-uk" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Shipping to Africa and the Middle East from the UK<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Choose from three simple options to send your parcels overseas:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option%2b1c1a6.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option+1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C481%2C8192%2C5423&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option+1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C481%2C8192%2C5423&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option+1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C481%2C8192%2C5423&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Post Office ParcelShop" width="1000" height="662" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book your delivery online and drop it off at any of our 9,000+ ParcelShops nearby or visit our selected Post Offices to book in person. No printer? No problem! You can use our free Print in ParcelShop device. Then just give your parcel to the shop assistant, and we&#39;ll take care of the rest.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-ParcelShops-open ParcelShops page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->ParcelShops<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_30588a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have convenient and secure Lockers located across the UK for you to choose from, with most available 24/7. Simply book online, scan your barcode, place your parcel in a secure Locker, and we&#39;ll collect it for delivery.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Lockers-open Lockers page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops/lockers" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Lockers<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrJpbqstJ9-Wc5_EVRI_LOCATION_04_47448a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrJpbqstJ9-Wc5_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4744.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrJpbqstJ9-Wc5_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4744.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrJpbqstJ9-Wc5_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4744.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer is standing in the doorway of their home, holding their parcels and smiling. The courier can be seen facing towards the customer in a friendly conversation." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Did you know our couriers can collect straight from your door? Just go online to choose a convenient day and location at home or the office. We&#39;ll provide a one-hour window to pick up your parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Courier services-open Courier services page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Courier services<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="where-does-evri-deliver-in-africa-and-the-middle-east?" class="section-wrapper feature-link-cards" index=