in Bahrain, we deliver to 16 destinations in the Middle East. See how cheap it is for shipping to the Middle East to some of our most popular destinations:","Table prices quoted are for a ParcelShop Standard delivery of a 250g parcel. Quoted on 06\u002F05\u002F2026.  Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.","information_table$3056fcc4-446d-4baa-80dc-1fbe1849cfb5",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":234,"primary":236,"id":254,"slice_type":153,"slice_label":35},[235],{},{"Image":237},{"dimensions":238,"alt":239,"copyright":35,"url":240,"id":241,"edit":242,"mobile":244,"tablet":249},{"width":132,"height":133},"An older man is sat on a sofa with a laptop on his knee. The Evri website is visible on the screen. He looks deep in thought.","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C3553%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt",{"x":55,"y":243,"zoom":56,"background":57},3553,{"dimensions":245,"alt":239,"copyright":35,"url":246,"id":241,"edit":247},{"width":140,"height":141},"africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C821%2C8192%2C3821&w=343&h=160",{"x":55,"y":248,"zoom":56,"background":57},821,{"dimensions":250,"alt":239,"copyright":35,"url":251,"id":241,"edit":252},{"width":147,"height":148},"africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1336%2C8192%2C2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":55,"y":253,"zoom":56,"background":57},1336,"photo_block$26dbd7c0-ec98-4b6f-87d6-1f3887c536e7",{"variation":256,"version":31,"items":257,"primary":277,"id":281,"slice_type":282,"slice_label":35},"listNoIcon",[258,265,271],{"title":259,"content":260,"isNumbered":264},"Book your parcel delivery",[261],{"type":77,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":80},"Visit our website and choose to drop off your parcel or arrange a collection from your home or office. You can also book with us in person at selected Post Office ParcelShops.",[],true,{"title":266,"content":267,"isNumbered":264},"Print your label",[268],{"type":77,"text":269,"spans":270,"direction":80},"Print your postage label at home or at a local ParcelShop using our free Print in ParcelShop devices.",[],{"title":272,"content":273,"isNumbered":264},"Drop off your parcel or wait for its collection",[274],{"type":77,"text":275,"spans":276,"direction":80},"Choose from 10,000+ locations near you to drop off your parcel at a  ParcelShop or Evri Locker. If you've booked a courier collection service, we'll give you a 1-hour window on the day for when we'll collect your package.",[],{"theme":278,"title":279,"description":280,"showPaddingTop":20},"standard","How to send an international parcel","With delivery to over 200 countries and territories worldwide, we make sending international parcels easy. We’ll ask for more information about your parcel to help speed up the customs process. Our online booking collects all the information needed to make it fast and stress-free for you. Follow our three easy steps to post to Africa and the Middle East with ease:","list_block$cdd5df18-3916-4ff5-9a6d-bc493324fd30","list_block",{"variation":284,"version":31,"items":285,"primary":347,"id":357,"slice_type":358,"slice_label":35},"3Column",[286,308,327],{"Title":287,"Description":292,"Image":296,"Label":35,"UrlText":290,"Url":304,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":307,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[288],{"type":289,"text":290,"spans":291},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[293],{"type":77,"text":294,"spans":295,"direction":80},"Book your delivery online and drop it off at any of our 9,000+ ParcelShops nearby or visit our selected Post Offices to book in person. No printer? No problem! You can use our free Print in ParcelShop device. Then just give your parcel to the shop assistant, and we'll take care of the rest.",[],{"dimensions":297,"alt":299,"copyright":35,"url":300,"id":301,"edit":302},{"width":67,"height":298},662,"Post Office ParcelShop","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option+1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C481%2C8192%2C5423&w=1000&h=662","ZgKfWhAAACkAd80m",{"x":55,"y":303,"zoom":56,"background":57},481,{"link_type":92,"key":305,"url":306},"421d09fb-62ec-4e34-9c3d-793cdec62276","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":125},{"Title":309,"Description":313,"Image":317,"Label":35,"UrlText":311,"Url":323,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":326,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[310],{"type":289,"text":311,"spans":312},"Lockers",[],[314],{"type":77,"text":315,"spans":316,"direction":80},"We have convenient and secure Lockers located across the UK for you to choose from, with most available 24\u002F7. Simply book online, scan your barcode, place your parcel in a secure Locker, and we'll collect it for delivery.",[],{"dimensions":318,"alt":319,"copyright":35,"url":320,"id":321,"edit":322},{"width":67,"height":68},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"link_type":92,"key":324,"url":325},"6f0071aa-0a8c-44ea-8bd2-2c0d338308d4","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":125},{"Title":328,"Description":332,"Image":336,"Label":35,"UrlText":342,"Url":343,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":346,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[329],{"type":289,"text":330,"spans":331},"Courier collection",[],[333],{"type":77,"text":334,"spans":335,"direction":80},"Did you know our couriers can collect straight from your door? Just go online to choose a convenient day and location at home or the office. We'll provide a one-hour window to pick up your parcel.",[],{"dimensions":337,"alt":338,"copyright":35,"url":339,"id":340,"edit":341},{"width":67,"height":68},"A customer is standing in the doorway of their home, holding their parcels and smiling. The courier can be seen facing towards the customer in a friendly conversation.","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XrJpbqstJ9-Wc5_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4744.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XrJpbqstJ9-Wc5",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},"Courier services",{"link_type":92,"key":344,"url":345},"e2ab87cb-3754-4a2f-9fbc-cd2964675883","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":125},{"SectionTitle":348,"SectionDescription":353,"theme":35},[349],{"type":350,"text":351,"spans":352,"direction":80},"heading2","Shipping to Africa and the Middle East from the UK",[],[354],{"type":77,"text":355,"spans":356,"direction":80},"Choose from three simple options to send your parcels overseas:",[],"article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":360,"primary":378,"id":381,"slice_type":382,"slice_label":35},[361,365,369,373],{"title":208,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":362,"dataGtmTrack":35},{"link_type":92,"key":363,"url":364},"b36b4fae-73eb-40f7-a480-b4deb2388cd7","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fbahrain",{"title":214,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":366,"dataGtmTrack":35},{"link_type":92,"key":367,"url":368},"94e94d8b-2588-4f2f-a0ed-f8ae6d6896d2","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fisrael",{"title":217,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":370,"dataGtmTrack":35},{"link_type":92,"key":371,"url":372},"8b6f0c87-0aa2-43f5-92ae-5d26c1134f0b","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fkuwait",{"title":374,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":375,"dataGtmTrack":35},"Oman",{"link_type":92,"key":376,"url":377},"9949b68d-bcfe-494e-a056-dd53e18c9007","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Foman",{"sectionTitle":379,"sectionDescription":380,"pillEnabled":20,"showPaddingTop":20},"Where does Evri deliver in Africa and the Middle East?","With delivery to over 200 countries and territories worldwide, our international courier services are far-reaching across these continents.\n\nExplore our guides for some of our most popular destinations, covering everything you need from national holidays to address formats and the items you can send:","feature_link_cards$471f5854-c055-485d-811b-cd0049ee6aae","feature_link_cards",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":384,"primary":411,"id":412,"slice_type":382,"slice_label":35},[385,389,392,396,408],{"title":219,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":386,"dataGtmTrack":35},{"link_type":92,"key":387,"url":388},"c52c6090-3519-4303-bb7b-467375849bba","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fqatar",{"title":221,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":390,"dataGtmTrack":35},{"link_type":92,"key":371,"url":391},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fsaudi-arabia",{"title":393,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":394,"dataGtmTrack":35},"South Africa",{"link_type":92,"key":367,"url":395},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fsouth-africa",{"title":223,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":397,"dataGtmTrack":35},{"id":398,"type":399,"tags":400,"lang":15,"slug":402,"first_publication_date":403,"last_publication_date":404,"uid":405,"url":406,"link_type":18,"key":407,"isBroken":20},"aCLWjxIAAB8AoB5k","content-page",[401],"International","how-to-send-a-parcel-to-turkey","2025-05-13T05:55:30+0000","2026-05-06T05:02:06+0000","turkey","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fturkey","398b43fc-fdb7-4e74-af3c-0f4472067e76",{"title":226,"content":35,"pillEnabled":20,"link":409,"dataGtmTrack":35},{"link_type":92,"key":376,"url":410},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Funited-arab-emirates",{"sectionTitle":35,"sectionDescription":35,"pillEnabled":20,"showPaddingTop":20},"feature_link_cards$b0d93610-739a-4eda-a98f-c94c084e3505",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":414,"primary":415,"id":429,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":35},[],{"CardImage":416,"CardAvatar":73,"CardTitle":422,"CardText":423,"ButtonText":109,"ButtonUrl":427,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":417,"alt":35,"copyright":35,"url":418,"id":419,"edit":420},{"width":67,"height":68},"africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":55,"y":421,"zoom":56,"background":57},2,"How long will my parcel take to be delivered?",[424],{"type":77,"text":425,"spans":426,"direction":80},"Our delivery time for shipping to Africa is estimated between 12 and 21 working days, depending on the destination. Similarly, for shipping to the Middle East, we also estimate 5-17 working days for your parcel to arrive.",[],{"link_type":92,"key":428,"url":112},"c594ea8a-a454-449e-8876-f69f6940b79b","card$9fe1ff41-eaa7-4147-9697-c7b77ef87fa6",{"variation":116,"version":31,"items":431,"primary":433,"id":458,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":35},[432],{},{"CardAvatar":73,"CardTitle":434,"CardText":435,"ButtonText":455,"ButtonUrl":456,"IsEco":20},"Sending multiple parcels abroad",[436,445,449,452],{"type":77,"text":437,"spans":438,"direction":80},"If you're sending gifts to post to Africa or shipping to the Middle East with your international business, our bulk integrations tool makes it easy. Send multiple parcels quickly and efficiently in just a few clicks.",[439,444],{"start":440,"end":441,"type":90,"data":442},111,128,{"link_type":92,"url":443,"target":94},"africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"start":440,"end":441,"type":96},{"type":446,"text":447,"spans":448,"direction":80},"o-list-item","Connect your seller accounts like eBay, Etsy, Amazon and Shopify to your Evri account and click 'Link Account', or upload parcels via a CSV file",[],{"type":446,"text":450,"spans":451,"direction":80},"Weigh and package your items, book your delivery, and print postage labels at home or in-store using our Print in ParcelShop devices",[],{"type":446,"text":453,"spans":454,"direction":80},"Send your parcels using our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a convenient courier collection day",[],"View integrations",{"link_type":92,"key":457,"url":443},"d6eaa86b-8d0c-4bc8-8328-614c8e578b09","card$dffdce3c-d664-4817-b794-7eb0a596bd9d",{"variation":460,"version":31,"items":461,"primary":541,"id":544,"slice_type":282,"slice_label":35},"listComponent",[462,481,493,505,517,529],{"title":463,"content":464,"icon":474},"Regular tracking updates",[465],{"type":77,"text":466,"spans":467,"direction":80},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[468,473],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":90,"data":471},55,63,{"link_type":92,"url":472,"target":94},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":469,"end":470,"type":96},{"dimensions":475,"alt":477,"copyright":35,"url":478,"id":479,"edit":480},{"width":476,"height":476},40,"Phone icon","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":482,"content":483,"icon":487},"Parcel cover",[484],{"type":77,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":80},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":488,"alt":489,"copyright":35,"url":490,"id":491,"edit":492},{"width":476,"height":476},"Money icon","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":494,"content":495,"icon":499},"Customs made easier",[496],{"type":77,"text":497,"spans":498,"direction":80},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":500,"alt":501,"copyright":35,"url":502,"id":503,"edit":504},{"width":476,"height":476},"Passport icon","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":506,"content":507,"icon":511},"Flexible printing options",[508],{"type":77,"text":509,"spans":510,"direction":80},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":512,"alt":513,"copyright":35,"url":514,"id":515,"edit":516},{"width":476,"height":476},"Printer icon","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":518,"content":519,"icon":523},"Bulk send",[520],{"type":77,"text":521,"spans":522,"direction":80},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":524,"alt":525,"copyright":35,"url":526,"id":527,"edit":528},{"width":476,"height":476},"Laptop icon","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":530,"content":531,"icon":535},"Trusted by top UK brands",[532],{"type":77,"text":533,"spans":534,"direction":80},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":536,"alt":537,"copyright":35,"url":538,"id":539,"edit":540},{"width":476,"height":476},"Success icon","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"theme":278,"title":542,"description":543},"Why send international parcels with Evri?","Our international services include all the following benefits:","list_block$5561303f-d955-4b8d-a3c8-2302fd07d450",{"variation":116,"version":31,"items":546,"primary":547,"id":575,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":35},[],{"CardAvatar":73,"CardTitle":548,"CardText":549,"ButtonText":35,"ButtonUrl":574,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send overseas",[550,559],{"type":77,"text":551,"spans":552,"direction":80},"While you can send lots of items with Evri, there are a few limitations you’ll need to be aware of. Check out our full breakdown of what you can and can’t send internationally for all the information you need.",[553,558],{"start":554,"end":555,"type":90,"data":556},132,159,{"link_type":92,"url":443,"target":557},"_self",{"start":554,"end":555,"type":96},{"type":77,"text":560,"spans":561,"direction":80},"You should also follow the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to keep up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels via airlines.",[562,567,568,573],{"start":563,"end":564,"type":90,"data":565},27,59,{"link_type":92,"url":566,"target":557},"africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":563,"end":564,"type":96},{"start":569,"end":570,"type":90,"data":571},68,95,{"link_type":92,"url":572,"target":557},"africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":569,"end":570,"type":96},{"link_type":125},"card$c75d938e-04fe-496b-a76f-5d225c2d2d08",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":577,"primary":579,"id":597,"slice_type":153,"slice_label":35},[578],{},{"Image":580},{"dimensions":581,"alt":582,"copyright":35,"url":583,"id":584,"edit":585,"mobile":587,"tablet":592},{"width":132,"height":133},"Customer looking down at their mobile with the display showing their international tracking in full view","africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7S3VJ7c43Q3f7tp_Customerreceivingdeliverynotificationonphone.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C657%2C6888%2C1607&w=1200&h=280","Z7S3VJ7c43Q3f7tp",{"x":55,"y":586,"zoom":56,"background":57},657,{"dimensions":588,"alt":582,"copyright":35,"url":589,"id":584,"edit":590},{"width":140,"height":141},"africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7S3VJ7c43Q3f7tp_Customerreceivingdeliverynotificationonphone.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C407%2C6888%2C3213&w=343&h=160",{"x":55,"y":591,"zoom":56,"background":57},407,{"dimensions":593,"alt":582,"copyright":35,"url":594,"id":584,"edit":595},{"width":147,"height":148},"africa-and-the-middle-east.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7S3VJ7c43Q3f7tp_Customerreceivingdeliverynotificationonphone.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C750%2C6888%2C2348&w=704&h=240",{"x":55,"y":596,"zoom":56,"background":57},750,"photo_block$3bb237d5-129d-44f2-8542-f114a3d00cf0",{"variation":116,"version":31,"items":599,"primary":601,"id":620,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":35},[600],{},{"CardAvatar":73,"CardTitle":602,"CardText":603,"ButtonText":35,"ButtonUrl":619,"IsEco":20},"Shipping to Africa and the Middle East is easy with Evri",[604,607,610],{"type":77,"text":605,"spans":606,"direction":80},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":77,"text":608,"spans":609,"direction":80},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":77,"text":611,"spans":612,"direction":80},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[613,618],{"start":614,"end":615,"type":90,"data":616},30,65,{"link_type":92,"url":617,"target":94},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":614,"end":615,"type":96},{"link_type":125},"card$fb4e1635-ae6a-45c8-91c5-1b5ec79478f5",[29,60,115,127,154,185,205,233,255,283,359,383,413,430,459,545,576,598],["Reactive",623],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":624,"$sclients":690,"$sglobal-basket-count":35,"$sglobal-user-postcode":693},{"abtasty":625,"accessibe":628,"appPromoBanner":631,"autoDivertUpdates":634,"awin":637,"bulkInternational":640,"bulkSendEnabled":643,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":646,"enableBasketCount":649,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":652,"euCustomsDuty":655,"groovyAdvert":658,"newInternationalSendFlow":661,"newinternationalpages":668,"oohPreferenceFlag":672,"opentel":675,"premium":678,"savedCards":681,"smallParcelSize":684,"yourPricesDrawer":687},{"_createdAt":626,"_updatedAt":627,"enabled":264},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":629,"_updatedAt":630,"enabled":264},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":632,"_updatedAt":633,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":635,"_updatedAt":636,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":638,"_updatedAt":639,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":641,"_updatedAt":642,"enabled":26